{
  "summary": "The experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multimodal multiprofile setup with imagenet_vit_l image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion, which previously achieved high performance. The validation accuracy of 0.7062 suggests this configuration may be effective, though the specific contribution of the RNA encoder remains uncertain without direct comparison to pca_n2000."
}

